<title>BANGLADESH: Ten killed, 40 injured in Bangladesh bus crash.</title>
<headline>Ten killed, 40 injured in Bangladesh bus crash.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>At least 10 people were killed and 40 injured on Tuesday when a bus skidded off the road in Bangladesh's southwestern district of Madaripur, the official BSS news ageny said.</p>
<p>The injured were rushed to nearby hospitals, the agency said.</p>
</text>
